### Code / Terminal Snippets
```bash
1. wget https://challenge-files.cylabacademy.net/library/a5d365fedad883763fb28c78e25a1765220bef6501848c84f2a7a7adf74d83cd/flag.txt
2. cat flag.txt
3. mv flag.txt flag.png
4. xdg-open flag.png 
```

