## 🚀 Exploitation / Solution Path
Detail your step-by-step breakdown to get the flag:
1. Download the file from challenge using `wget`.
2. See the content with `cat` or any other text editor.
3. move the extension of file from `txt to png`.
4. Open the image with `xdg-open`.
5. The flag will be displayed.

